&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a dual-mandate sales role with real commercial ownership — and the person who thrives here will be as comfortable hunting new logo opportunities in the long-tail market as they are driving expansion across an existing account portfolio. As Inside Sales Manager for APAC, you&#39;ll own the full sales cycle for Duetto&#39;s Silver accounts and long-tail prospects across the region, ensuring systematic coverage of accounts that field reps can&#39;t dedicate enough time to — and closing the deals that add up to meaningful ARR. If you&#39;re a target-driven, hunter-mentality sales professional with a feel for hospitality technology, this is your opportunity to own a segment and make it perform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us Different?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Duetto is the hospitality industry&#39;s leading revenue management platform, founded in 2012 by former Wynn Resorts executives who knew the industry needed better technology. We built the world&#39;s first Revenue &amp;amp; Profit Operating System — a suite of tools (GameChanger, ScoreBoard, BlockBuster, Advance and more) that goes beyond room pricing to give hotels, resorts and casinos a complete picture of their revenue and profitability. Trusted by clients ranging from independent boutique hotels to global chains, we&#39;ve been named the #1 Revenue Management Software by HotelTechAwards four years running and the #1 Best Place to Work in Hotel Tech in 2025. Backed by GrowthCurve Capital since 2024, we&#39;re accelerating our investment in AI — and we&#39;re genuinely passionate about the industry we serve. We build products we&#39;re proud of, for customers we care about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own the expansion pipeline across assigned Silver accounts — driving adoption of Advance, GameTime, and HotStats through structured outreach, upsell conversations, and cross-sell campaigns in close coordination with the BDR and CSM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll identify and close new logo opportunities in the long-tail market segment (properties under 150 rooms) — managing the full sales cycle from qualification through proposal to close, with independent pricing authority up to the market threshold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll coordinate structured outreach campaigns across calls, email, and social with the BDR team, and work with Marketing on timely follow-up of inbound leads to maximise conversion from interest to opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner with field Sales to align territory and account strategy — ensuring clean coverage, avoiding overlap, and freeing Directors of Sales to focus on larger strategic opportunities while you own the long-tail and Silver segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll maintain accurate opportunity data and forecasting in Salesforce, keeping full pipeline visibility across the team and leadership at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll use AI tools to accelerate prospect profiling, analysis, and outreach — applying your relationship-building instincts and deal judgment where AI can&#39;t, and staying sharp on the human edge that closes deals in a consultative hospitality tech sale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;2–3 years of experience in SaaS inside sales or business development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A hunter mentality — you&#39;re driven by hitting targets, energised by pipeline building, and comfortable owning a full sales cycle independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong communication, negotiation, and presentation skills — you&#39;re comfortable engaging hotel owners, GMs, and Revenue Managers at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce CRM and sales engagement platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;The right to work in Singapore or Thailand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong candidates may also have:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Prior experience selling into hospitality technology or revenue management solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the APAC hospitality market — hotel ownership structures, buying dynamics, and key segments across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience coordinating with BDR, CSM, and Marketing teams in a cross-functional inside sales motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Duetto?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real commercial ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll have independent pricing authority, a dual mandate across new logo and expansion, and clear CARR targets — the accountability is genuine and so is the opportunity to make a visible impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A segment that&#39;s ready.&lt;/strong&gt; Long-tail and Silver accounts are underserved by field reps — there&#39;s real pipeline to build and real deals to close for the right person who shows up with energy and discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI accelerates your edge.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll use AI tools for prospect profiling and outreach groundwork — freeing your time for the relationship-building and deal judgment that closes business in a consultative sale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A product worth selling.&lt;/strong&gt; The #1 RMS in hospitality tech, trusted globally — when you call a Revenue Manager or GM, you&#39;re leading with a platform they&#39;ve heard of and a category that matters to their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Location: Singapore or Bangkok (Remote)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Department: Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Reports to: VP, APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Direct reports: None&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Duetto is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound like you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You don&#39;t need to have sold Duetto before. If you have inside sales experience in SaaS or hospitality tech, a genuine hunter mentality, and the drive to own a segment in one of the most exciting hospitality markets in the world — we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
